Getting Started

This zip package contains the following files:

README.1ST	This file
SUNNY.OPL		Sunrise/sunset calculation routines
SUNNY.WRD	S3a word documentation for SUNNY.OPL
CALLTEST.OPL	Sample program showing usage

Copy the files (except this one) to either the OPL or WRD directories on any disk on the S3a, and then translate the OPL programs using the OPL editors.

Enjoy!


